{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50238","headline":"寓止观中因抒感怀 · 刘延坚","name":"寓止观中因抒感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯阳宫馆好烟霞，知换浮生几岁华。\n虽访灵芝身不远，未逢真诀道还赊。\n玉清难测无穷景，金露能摧有限花。\n南待总抛荣辱了，始应亲近得仙家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘延坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}